  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Augusta, GA\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Augusta, GA\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAugusta, GA\nEmergency and Specialty\n706.733.7458\n410 Topgolf Way\nAugusta, GA 30909\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nTue-Fri by appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nWe’ve grown!\nWelcome Dr. McGovern, DACVIM (SAIM), to the internal medicine team. We’re now offering more appointments for internal medicine patients – please call the hospital for scheduling.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving the communities of Augusta, GA.\nWe are located in Augusta, GA serving pet owners in the Augusta area. We’re located right off Riverwatch Pkwy, near I-20 exit 200.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen you have a pet emergency, seconds count. We want you to know, we’re ready. If your pet has a condition that requires a specialist’s expertise, we’re ready for that too. Our experienced veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nWhile there is no appointment necessary for our emergency vet services, please call ahead and let us know you’re coming.\nEmergencies are stressful, but once you arrive at our pet hospital, our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work together quickly to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs. With in-house lab diagnostics, including x-rays and a CT scanner, we’re prepared to triage, diagnose and treat your pet during an emergency.\nSpecialty care\nAvailable by referral, the compassionate clinicians at BluePearl treat pets with complex or chronic illnesses and injuries. Our services are available for pets who need specialized diagnostics, treatments or procedures.\nOur goal is to provide the highest quality veterinary care possible by acting as an extension of your primary care veterinarian. We do this by nurturing a strong relationship with you and your veterinarian through open communication, recommendations and treatment by our trained specialists, access to advanced technology and support care by our compassionate staff.\nTo learn more about the specialties offered at our Augusta hospital, visit our\nSpecialties & Services page\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nCurrent location.\n706.733.7458\n706.737.4399\n410 Topgolf Way\nAugusta,\nGA                                    30909\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSummerville, SC\n319 E 3rd N St\nSummerville, SC 29483\n843.216.1331\n112.11 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSavannah, GA\n335 Stephenson Ave\nSavannah, GA 31405\n912.354.6681\n117.01 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nJohns Creek, GA\n7350 McGinnis Ferry Rd\nJohns Creek, GA 30024\n770.407.3000\n128.35 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
